Add up the enthalpy changes for all the steps:

ΔH_reaction = ΔH_formation [FeCl₄]²⁻ + ΔH_hydration [Fe²⁺] + ΔH_hydration [Cl⁻] + ΔH_dehydration [H₂O]

**Remember:**

* Pay attention to the signs of the enthalpy changes.
