3. **Simplify using trigonometric identities:**
   * cos(π/2 + α) = -sin α
   * sin(-π - α) = -sin α
   * cos(11π/2 - α) = cos(π/2 - α) = sin α
   * sin(11π/2 + α) = sin(π/2 + α) = cos α

