* **\(H(t)\)** is the Hubble parameter at time \(t\).
* **\(G\)** is the gravitational constant.
* **\(\rho\)** is the total energy density of the universe.
* **\(p\)** is the total pressure of the universe.
* **\(\dot{\rho}\)** is the time derivative of the energy density.

**The equation of state parameter, \(w\), relates pressure and energy density:**

