*  **φ:** Latitude of point P = 60°S
*  **f:**  Flattening of the Earth (1 - R<sub>p</sub>/R<sub>e</sub>) = 1 - 0.9966 = 0.0034

**2. Calculate the Radii**

*  **R<sub>e</sub> = R<sub>p</sub> / (1 - f)** 

