\[
V_{\text{voltmeter}} = \frac{M}{L_1} V_0.
\]
Substituting the expressions for $M$ and $L_1$:
\[
V_{\text{voltmeter}} = \frac{\mu_0 (N_1 + N_2) A / \ell}{\mu_0 N_1^2 A / \ell} V_0 = \frac{N_1 + N_2}{N_1^2} V_0.
